          "version": 1
        },
        "fields": {
          "notes": "A 377-page aggregate scholarly volume reported under the joint responsibility of Margaret W. Green and Hans J. Nissen, with collaboration by Peter Damerow and Robert K. Englund. Two source-reported contained works are represented here: Green's Sign List (pp. 167-345) and Damerow-Englund's numerical-systems contribution (pp. 117-166). Identification of the remaining sections is open."
        },
